'' RUN: std/chrono resolves a local wall reading without looking it up as UTC; AddCalendar*
'' re-resolves only a local reading's offset; AssumeLocal; Windows pre-1601 offsets.
'' Host-independent: the transition checks run in this machine's 2025 transitions, if any.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/chrono-zone-resolve.tiko -o tests/codegen/chronozoneresolve.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/chronozoneresolve.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/chronozoneresolve.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: ok
